msgid "Objects for Type Hinting"
msgstr "Objek untuk Petunjuk Tipe"

msgid ""
"Various built-in types for type hinting are provided.  Currently, two types "
"exist -- :ref:`GenericAlias <types-genericalias>` and :ref:`Union <types-"
"union>`.  Only ``GenericAlias`` is exposed to C."
msgstr ""
"Berbagai tipe bawaan untuk petunjuk tipe disediakan. Saat ini, ada dua tipe "
"-- :ref:`GenericAlias <types-genericalias>` dan :ref:`Union <types-union>`. "
"Hanya ``GenericAlias`` yang diekspos ke C."

msgid ""
"Create a :ref:`GenericAlias <types-genericalias>` object. Equivalent to "
"calling the Python class :class:`types.GenericAlias`.  The *origin* and "
"*args* arguments set the ``GenericAlias``\\ 's ``__origin__`` and "
"``__args__`` attributes respectively. *origin* should be "
"a :c:expr:`PyTypeObject*`, and *args* can be a :c:expr:`PyTupleObject*` or "
"any ``PyObject*``.  If *args* passed is not a tuple, a 1-tuple is "
"automatically constructed and ``__args__`` is set to ``(args,)``. Minimal "
"checking is done for the arguments, so the function will succeed even if "
"*origin* is not a type. The ``GenericAlias``\\ 's ``__parameters__`` "
"attribute is constructed lazily from ``__args__``.  On failure, an exception "
"is raised and ``NULL`` is returned."
msgstr ""
"Buat sebuah objek :ref:`GenericAlias <types-genericalias>`. Setara dengan "
"memanggil kelas Python :class:`types.GenericAlias`. Argumen *origin* dan "
"*args* mengatur atribut ``__origin__`` dan ``__args__`` dari "
"``GenericAlias`` masing-masing. *origin* harus "
"berupa :c:expr:`PyTypeObject*`, dan *args* dapat "
"berupa :c:expr:`PyTupleObject*` atau ``PyObject*`` apa pun. Jika *args* yang "
"diteruskan bukan sebuah tuple, sebuah 1-tuple akan dibuat secara otomatis "
"dan ``__args__`` diatur ke ``(args,)``. Pemeriksaan yang dilakukan terhadap "
"argumen sangat minimal, sehingga fungsi ini akan berhasil meskipun *origin* "
"bukan sebuah tipe. Atribut ``__parameters__`` dari ``GenericAlias`` dibuat "
"secara lazy dari ``__args__``. Jika gagal, sebuah eksepsi dimunculkan dan "
"``NULL`` dikembalikan."

msgid "Here's an example of how to make an extension type generic::"
msgstr "Berikut contoh cara membuat sebuah tipe ekstensi menjadi generik::"

msgid ""
"...\n"
"static PyMethodDef my_obj_methods[] = {\n"
"    // Other methods.\n"
"    ...\n"
"    {\"__class_getitem__\", Py_GenericAlias, METH_O|METH_CLASS, \"my_obj is "
"generic over its contained type\"}\n"
"    ...\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"...\n"
"static PyMethodDef my_obj_methods[] = {\n"
"    // Other methods.\n"
"    ...\n"
"    {\"__class_getitem__\", Py_GenericAlias, METH_O|METH_CLASS, \"my_obj is "
"generic over its contained type\"}\n"
"    ...\n"
"}"

msgid "The data model method :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`."
msgstr "Metode model data :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`."

msgid ""
"The C type of the object returned by :c:func:`Py_GenericAlias`. Equivalent "
"to :class:`types.GenericAlias` in Python."
msgstr ""
"Tipe C dari objek yang dikembalikan oleh :c:func:`Py_GenericAlias`. Setara "
"dengan :class:`types.GenericAlias` di Python."
